1
00:00:00,839 --> 00:00:02,129
(Penny:)I didn't have any quarters.

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:05,760
(Penny:)So I've been sneaking stuff
into other people's loads all day.

3
00:00:06,219 --> 00:00:08,889
(Penny:)If I tell you something,
you promise not to tell anybody?

4
00:00:09,097 --> 00:00:11,387
(Leonard:)Doesn't matter what I say,
you're gonna tell me anyway.

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,980
Wha?... That is not true.

6
00:00:16,313 --> 00:00:18,773
(Penny:)Bernadette wants a prenup.

7
00:00:19,357 --> 00:00:20,397
(Leonard:)Wow.

8
00:00:20,609 --> 00:00:22,069
(Leonard:)That's rough.

9
00:00:22,277 --> 00:00:24,777
(Penny:)If I became a famous movie star
and we got married...

10
00:00:24,988 --> 00:00:28,118
(Penny:)- ...you wouldn't sign a prenup?
- Heh, absolutely not.

11
00:00:28,617 --> 00:00:30,447
If I'm gonna be at home
with the kids...

12
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:34,750
(Leonard:)...while you're on location
cheating on me with Ryan Gosling...

13
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:38,630
(Leonard:)...then Leonard gots to get paid.

14
00:00:39,461 --> 00:00:42,171
So do you think about us
getting married?

15
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:43,800
I think about a Iot of things.

16
00:00:44,007 --> 00:00:46,597
(Penny:)I think about us getting married,
about us breaking up.

17
00:00:46,801 --> 00:00:50,971
(Penny:)Once in a while, I think about how I didn't
Ieave a note on that Mercedes I dinged...

18
00:00:51,181 --> 00:00:53,811
(Penny:)...but then I have a glass of wine
and it passes.

19
00:00:55,143 --> 00:00:57,103
(Leonard:)Joke all you want,
but you think about it.

20
00:00:57,312 --> 00:01:02,272
(Penny:)Well, tell you one thing, if I ever do
get married, no Klingon invitations.

